*.py[cod]

build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
repos/

# pytest-benchmark's store. Every other tool cache in this tree self-ignores
# (ruff, pytest, mypy and Hypothesis each write a .gitignore holding `*` inside
# the directory they create), which is why none of them is listed here and none
# has ever appeared in git status. pytest-benchmark does not, so this one needs
# saying. It is empty today and git does not track an empty directory, so the
# gap is invisible until the first --benchmark-autosave run writes into it.
.benchmarks/

# The chapter 19 C examples' compiled objects, built by check.sh and
# worktree.sh when a compiler is present. cstore.so was tracked until
# 2026-08-27 because nothing built it, so one machine's binary rode in the
# repository while its own README told a reader to compile it.
examples/ch19-spaces-backed-by-anything/*/*.so

# The engine's C reader artifact, built by check.sh beside engine/reader.c
engine/reader.so

# The C binding's build products. cetta.c and cetta.h are the source; the
# shared library, the examples, the suite and the parity driver are all built
# by bindings/cetta/Makefile and are one machine's binaries.
bindings/cetta/libcetta.so
bindings/cetta/examples/hello
bindings/cetta/examples/ops
bindings/cetta/examples/stream
bindings/cetta/tests/test_cetta
bindings/cetta/kit/driver

# The opt-in mypyc build (PYMETTA_USE_MYPYC=1), which writes extensions beside
# the source they were built from. Shipping one would also SHADOW the pure
# Python module for every later run in the checkout, so it is ignored and
# check.sh's own build is out of tree.
bindings/python/metta/*.so

# Agent scratch: books, cloned prior art, gate logs, tree copies, working
# ledgers. Never released, and skipped by .codespellrc for the same reason;
# a ledger meant to persist lives at the workspace root outside this repo.
ai-tmp/
ai-*.md
ai-tmp-*

# The Node binding fetches swipl-wasm with npm; it is a build input, not
# source, and the same shape as any other node_modules in the tree.
bindings/node/node_modules/
*.qlf
engine/.qlf-stamp

# Browser-automation scratch. Four of these console logs and page snapshots
# were committed by accident on 2026-08-21 as part of an unrelated merge;
# they are session debris, not a deliverable.
.playwright-mcp/
